#Linux
Ibisohoka andika: (Itegeko ls -la), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: (Inzira /home gabor Desktop), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: (Inzira /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: ((Itegeko ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: ((Itegeko do: ['this'], na: ['that'])), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: ((Inzira go: ['here'], na: ['there'])), umurongo-mushya.